  "tagline": "Chinese native distributed graph database for HTAP graph workloads in banking and energy.",
  "description": "Galaxybase is a commercial, native distributed property-graph database from CreateLink (Zhejiang Chuanglin Technology) in Hangzhou. Its storage layout is designed for fast traversals and single-edge lookups, and it supports concurrent transactional and analytical graph workloads (HTAP), as described in a VLDB 2024 paper. It is deployed mainly by Chinese banks, power grids and telecoms for risk control and knowledge graphs, and the vendor now bundles it with graph-RAG and enterprise AI products. Documentation and support are primarily in Chinese.",
